WEBVTT

00:00:05.574 --> 00:00:12.860
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> What I want to know is does this woman…love me?

00:00:14.561 --> 00:00:17.121
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> You remember the end of your dream?

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.872
You were feeling cold?

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.080
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> Yes, my feet were very cold.

00:00:23.198 --> 00:00:30.100
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Well…I think perhaps you already know the answer to your question.

00:00:33.795 --> 00:00:35.020
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> You mean she doesn’t love me?

00:00:37.678 --> 00:00:40.740
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> No, I don’t think so.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:46.540
I think you will need to find somebody else.

00:00:49.395 --> 00:00:50.140
I’m sorry.